{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/39a861a69dfc2fc131328c14c5bdd2b5.poster.avif?t=1759926843\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/39a861a69dfc2fc131328c14c5bdd2b5.webm?t=1759926843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/39a861a69dfc2fc131328c14c5bdd2b5.mp4?t=1759926843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LARGE Little: A Tiny Man's Story</strong> invites you into Tony\u2019s seemingly ordinary garden, brimming with imagination. From a first-person (FPS) perspective, you\u2019ll step into this miniature world, meet both friendly and hostile animals, complete the tasks they give you, and form unforgettable bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this garden, every corner hides something to discover: secret passages, little mysteries, and the small wonders of everyday life. As your journey unfolds, each step will lead you to new discoveries\u2014about both yourself and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1e <strong>Bond with animal friends</strong> \u2013 take on quests, lend a hand, or escape from those who pose a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Explore the garden</strong> \u2013 a world full of secret paths, tiny mysteries, and surprising encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Quests and progression system</strong> \u2013 earn, grow, and unlock new missions as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A living environment</strong> \u2013 the garden is not just a backdrop, but a vibrant world that responds to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner holds experiences that are both fun and thought-provoking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/c19a16ce8bb90939a6cfce2266408166.poster.avif?t=1759926843\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/c19a16ce8bb90939a6cfce2266408166.webm?t=1759926843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/c19a16ce8bb90939a6cfce2266408166.mp4?t=1759926843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952360?t=1759926843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952360?t=1759926843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/85fc5dbe25e169ce8410488fa472ae8adaa31ae3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759926843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/85fc5dbe25e169ce8410488fa472ae8adaa31ae3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759926843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/39a861a69dfc2fc131328c14c5bdd2b5.poster.avif?t=1759926843\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/extras/39a861a69dfc2fc131328c14c5bdd2b5.webm?t=1759926843\" type=\"vi